                <pb facs="0337" n="219" sameAs="frus:frus1928v02/pg219"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">893.00 Tsinan/5: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to
                        the Minister in China</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic"
                            >MacMurray</hi>)</head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1928-05-03T17:00:00-04:00"><hi rendition="#italic">May 3, 1928—5
                                p.m.</hi></date></dateline></opener>
                <p>144. Your 303, May 3, 6 p.m.<anchor n="39" xml:id="d153-f1"/> Can you ascertain
                    and inform Department by telegram present situation with regard to American
                    Consul and other Americans at Tsinan?</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Kellogg</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
